          "usability": "Handbook explains touch actions; large named controls, contextual route/recover labels, planning route and OFF confirmation supported completion. No observed blocking UI failures.",
          "readability": "Primary HUD and objectives were clear at 390x844. Small patrol silhouettes, distant coil hardware and dark obstructing architecture were harder to parse; overlay badges help."
